{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":18097,\"date\":\"2026-09-28T15:35:48+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-28T13:35:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-tv-screensaver-audio-si-parte-da-snoopy\",\"title\":\"Apple TV: gli screensaver potrebbero avere l’audio, si parte da Snoopy\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel codice di tvOS 27 sono emerse impostazioni nascoste per attivare effetti sonori nei salvaschermo di Apple TV. Il primo a beneficiarne potrebbe essere quello dedicato a Snoopy.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/tvos-27-salvaschermo-audio-featured-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"tvos-27-salvaschermo-audio-featured\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":18050,\"date\":\"2026-09-25T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-25T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-beta-pubblica-ios-27-2-ipados-27-2-macos-27-2-app-salute\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta pubblica di iOS 27.2, iPadOS 27.2 e macOS 27.2: arriva l’app Salute\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibile la prima beta pubblica di iOS 27.2, iPadOS 27.2 e macOS 27.2: la nuova app Salute è tra le novità provabili da subito dai tester.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/ios-27.2-beta-1-pubblica-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-27.2-beta-1-pubblica\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":18020,\"date\":\"2026-09-23T12:33:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-23T10:33:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-pubbliche-ios-27-2-macos-golden-gate-27-2\",\"title\":\"Apple avvia le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 27.2 e macOS Golden Gate 27.2\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 27.2, iPadOS 27.2, macOS Golden Gate 27.2, tvOS 27.2 e watchOS 27.2. Novità principali: app Salute ridisegnata e nuove opzioni in Apple TV con Siri AI in più lingue.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iOS-27.2-Next-to-iPhone-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27.2-Next-to-iPhone\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17962,\"date\":\"2026-09-21T22:34:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-21T20:34:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-beta-watchos-27-2-tvos-27-2-visionos-27-2\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le seconde beta di watchOS 27.2, tvOS 27.2 e visionOS 27.2\",\"excerpt\":\"A una settimana dalla prima tornata, Apple distribuisce le seconde beta di watchOS 27.2, tvOS 27.2 e visionOS 27.2. In parallelo, iOS 27.2 e watchOS 27.2 introducono test per la nuova app Salute con Insights e Longevity.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17858,\"date\":\"2026-09-18T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-18T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-watchos-27-2-tvos-27-2-visionos-27-2\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta di watchOS 27.2, tvOS 27.2 e visionOS 27.2\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha reso disponibili le prime versioni beta di watchOS 27.2, tvOS 27.2 e visionOS 27.2, aprendo la fase di test per le piattaforme dedicate a Apple Watch, Apple TV e Vision Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"General-visionOS-watchOS-and-tvOS-Betas-Feature-Redux\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17619,\"date\":\"2026-09-11T09:06:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-11T07:06:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-l-ultima-beta-di-ios-27-e-non-solo\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia l’ultima beta di iOS 27 (e non solo)\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple distribuisce iOS 27 RC insieme a nuove beta per iPadOS, macOS, watchOS, tvOS e visionOS, con un focus su stabilità e Siri AI.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/ios-27-three-iphones-fi.jpg-768x384.webp\",\"imageAlt\":\"ios-27-three-iphones-fi.jpg\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17478,\"date\":\"2026-09-05T11:53:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-05T09:53:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-iphone-18-pro-anteprima-evento-9-settembre-2026\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra e iPhone 18 Pro: anteprima dell’evento Apple del 9 settembre\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple terrà l’evento “Surprise and Shine” mercoledì 9 settembre alle 10:00 (PT). Attesi iPhone Ultra pieghevole, iPhone 18 Pro con nuove fotocamere e aggiornamenti su Watch e AirPods.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Everything-Apple-Is-Expected-to-Announce-At-Surprise-and-Shine-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,